SUMMARY:Story Land
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the world of exciting stories! In this workshop\, children will explore a world of exciting and imaginative tales through interactive activities. Children will learn how to identify\, understand and express their feelings. They will also be able to enrich their imaginations with words and create endless worlds of stories they discover. Join us on our journey into the whimsical world of imagination! For in this interactive workshop\, children will learn how to identify\, understand and express their feelings.
